      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VINTAGE GEM (3) is a progressive type who recorded her 3rd career win last time out (22.49) at this track. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Well placed and will be tough to beat. FEARLESS COBRA (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 400m behind Alfred Keeping (23.45) in a Grade 6. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Must be included in calculations. IMPRESS ROCKS (2) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 6th over 400m at this track in Grade 5/6 company. Solid record here at the distance winning 11 races. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SHAKE NOT STIR (4) dominated last start. Sure to run well again.",
